{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112553","id":2991662702,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6yUSZu","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112553","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112553.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112553.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112553","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112553/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112553/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112553/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ee165751334196d1dee017cbebd343144206b310","number":112553,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[.NET] Expose PropertyUsageFlags in ExportAttribute","user":{"login":"GabCoolDude","id":123309403,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1mNWw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123309403?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude","html_url":"https://github.com/GabCoolDude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Overview\r\n\r\nThis allows for `[Export]` to change a property's `usage` without having to use `_GetPropertyList` or `_ValidateProperty`. It also brings `[Export]` back up to speed with GDScript's `@export_custom`, which also allows for this.\r\n\r\n```cs\r\n// Before:\r\n[Export] public int Health;\r\n\r\npublic override void _ValidateProperty(Godot.Collections.Dictionary property)\r\n{\r\n    if (property[\"name\"].AsStringName() == PropertyName.Health)\r\n    {\r\n        var usage = property[\"usage\"].As<PropertyUsageFlags>() | PropertyUsageFlags.ReadOnly;\r\n        property[\"usage\"] = (int)usage;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n// After:\r\n[Export(usageFlags: PropertyUsageFlags.ReadOnly | PropertyUsageFlags.Default)]\r\npublic int Health;\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt works by adding an additional optional constructor argument to `ExportAttribute` and assigning it to a `UsageFlags` property. Then in `ScriptPropertiesGenerator`, we just simply grab the constructor argument's value, similar to how it's done for `PropertyHint`\r\n\r\n# How to test\r\n\r\n- [Setup a .NET build of Godot](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.html) based on this PR\r\n- Use [this](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23432482/dotnet-propertyusageflags-export.zip) project to test easily and compare behavior between GDScript and C# (should be the same, but just in-case).\r\n- Mess around\r\n\r\n# Notes\r\n\r\nI consider this PR to be ready, however there is the possibility that tests might be needed. Currently, only base `[Export]` is tested in `Godot.SourceGenerators.Tests`, if I were to add tests for PropertyUsageFlags, how would I go about it, and would I need to add tests for `PropertyHint` and `HintString` ? We could also leave tests to do in a follow-up PR.\r\n\r\nThere should also be some changes made to [this](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.html) documentation page about C# exported properties. I will handle it as soon as this is merged.\r\n\r\nCloses godotengine/godot-proposals#2957","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35: